<title>FRANCE: Yemen postpones wheat, flour tenders to Jan 7.</title>
<headline>Yemen postpones wheat, flour tenders to Jan 7.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yemen has postponed until January 7 a tender for soft wheat grain and soft wheat flour initially scheduled for December 26, European grain traders said on Monday.</p>
<p>Yemen is seeking 200,000 tonnes of optional soft wheat flour for shipment between February and June and 200,000 tonnes of new crop U.S. or Canadian or Australian soft white wheat for July-September shipment, they said.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
